  "prefLabel": "Ncr 734.02 Trail Use Limitations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 734.02 Trail Use Limitations. The public shall not use sleds, toboggans, saucers, and similar equipment, except snow tubes provided by the state park, or motor propelled devices on trails, both cross country and downhill, or slopes unless permission has been granted by special use permit pursuant to Ncr 740.\n\nSource. #14055 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14291, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr700.html"
